# Playground Hooks

All hooks live in `hooks/` (embedded at `src/app/playground/hooks/` in the host).

## Hook Reference

| Hook | Purpose | Used By |
|------|---------|---------|
| `useGenerationCoordination.ts` | Owns generation/scan coordination refs behind typed accessors | Generation scan, lifecycle, chat, drag-drop |
| `useIterationScan.ts` | Iteration file scan, prompt-copy poll, SSE fallback poll; returns `stopPolling` | `PlaygroundCanvas.tsx` |
| `useGenerationLifecycle.ts` | Timer, reconcile, SSE, resume-after-reload, START/COMPLETE/ERROR | `PlaygroundCanvas.tsx` |
| `useChatSubmit.ts` | Chat submit + generation queue drain | `PlaygroundCanvas.tsx` |
| `useDragToIterate.ts` | Drag-to-iterate + `useDragIterateEventHandler` | `PlaygroundCanvas.tsx` |
| `useCanvasKeyboard.ts` | Consolidated canvas keyboard shortcuts | `PlaygroundCanvas.tsx` |
| `useCanvasDrawTool.ts` | Freehand ink + drag-to-draw shapes | `PlaygroundCanvas.tsx` |
| `useCanvasAutoArrange.ts` | Bento auto-arrange event shell | `PlaygroundCanvas.tsx` |
| `useCanvasPaste.ts` | Clipboard paste I/O (image/JSX/URL/HTML) | `PlaygroundCanvas.tsx` |
| `useCanvasDragDrop.ts` | Sidebar DnD + file drop + iteration attach | `PlaygroundCanvas.tsx` |
| `useCanvasPersistence.ts` | localStorage save + beforeunload viewport | `PlaygroundCanvas.tsx` |
| `useCanvasNodeDelete.ts` | Delete dialog + cascade/reparent API | `PlaygroundCanvas.tsx` |
| `useCanvasFrameOps.ts` | Group/ungroup, z-order, helper-line drag | `PlaygroundCanvas.tsx` |
| `useCanvasCreatePage.ts` | Create design/page dialog + `CREATE_DESIGN_EVENT` | `PlaygroundCanvas.tsx` |
| `useCanvasClipboard.ts` | Node copy/paste/duplicate for keyboard shortcuts | `PlaygroundCanvas.tsx` |
| `useCanvasClear.ts` | Clear-canvas dialog + `PLAYGROUND_CLEAR_EVENT` | `PlaygroundCanvas.tsx` |
| `useModelCycle.ts` | Docked chat model selection + flip animation | `DockedChatBar.tsx` |
| `useDynamicBackground.ts` | Dynamic canvas background dot sizing | `PlaygroundCanvas.tsx` |
| `useElementSelection.ts` | Alt+click DOM element selection in iframes | `ComponentNode.tsx`, `IterationNode.tsx` |
| `useNodeSelection.ts` | React Flow node selection for chat context | `PlaygroundCanvas.tsx` |
| `useNodeShared.ts` | Shared state across node types | `nodes/*.tsx` |

## Pure lib companions (Batch J)

| Module | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| `lib/canvas-auto-arrange.ts` | Bento cluster layout + collision resolution |
| `lib/canvas-visibility.ts` | Collapse filter + `hasChildren`/`isCollapsed` annotation |
| `lib/iteration-scan.ts` | Iteration positioning + parent lookup helpers |
| `lib/canvas-paste.ts` | Clipboard classification (`classifyClipboard`) |

## Shell components (Batch J / J2)

| Component | Purpose |
|-----------|---------|
| `PlaygroundCanvasToolbar.tsx` | Left rail tools |
| `PlaygroundCanvasDialogs.tsx` | Clear, delete, create-page dialogs |
| `PlaygroundCanvasContextMenu.tsx` | Right-click context menu |

